Copyright 2026 Justin Jäger

This project is a Python port/reimplementation inspired by:
  appletv-siri-voice by Marcus Adolfsson
  https://github.com/marcusadolfsson/appletv-siri-voice

HomeKit Target Control, HomeKit Data Stream framing/serialization, and Siri session
behavior were implemented with reference to HAP-NodeJS by the Homebridge project,
licensed under Apache License 2.0:
  https://github.com/homebridge/HAP-NodeJS

Runtime dependencies retain their respective licenses, including HAP-python,
cryptography, aiohttp, opuslib-next, and libopus.
